cstats (0.12.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * Add RMC Nation support (nationlist, nationdetails)
  * Add .deb builds, script by Pilzhut5
  * Update RMC playerstats and leaderboard to use new API and show Spleef stats
  * Updated credits on splash texts provided by Noggisoggi
  * Make join/leave messages appear correctly in RMC chat with new API changes
  * Add config option to show black (&0) color code as dark gray to make it visible on black background terminals (disabled by default)
  * Rewritten README.md 

  * Implement RetroMC country stats API (by Pilzhut5)
  * Add better table-like formatting to multiple lists (villagelist, nationlist, nationdetails, countries) (by Pilzhut5)
  * This can be disabled by toggling the compactLists config option to True
  * Add charts to nationdetails village activity payouts and leaderboards (by Pilzhut5)
  * This can be disabled by toggling the showCharts config option to False
  * Add visual world location maps for villages and online player locations (by Pilzhut5)
  * This can be disabled by toggling the showLocationMaps config option to False
  * Implement manually triggered UUID-username cache updater (by Pilzhut5)
  * Fix RetroMC playerstats crashing for users with no spleef stats and/or no player kills (by Pilzhut5) 
  * Allow opening config file automatically in options > showConfigPath (by Pilzhut5)
  * Display estimated GeoIP country in RetroMC playerstats as this info is now provided by the RetroMC API
  * Add displayColors toggle in config file
  * Remove RetroMC money leaderboard option as the RetroMC API no longer seems to provide it (by Pilzhut5)

